{"id":629,"name":"vullaby","speciesId":629,"dex":629,"form":"normal","generation":5,"types":["dark","flying"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":55,"defense":75,"special-attack":45,"special-defense":65,"speed":60},"abilities":[{"name":"big-pecks","hidden":false},{"name":"overcoat","hidden":false},{"name":"weak-armor","hidden":true}],"height":5,"weight":90,"baseExp":74,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/629.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/629.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/629.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/629.ogg","genus":"Diapered Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"y","text":"Their wings are too tiny to allow them to fly. They guard their posteriors with bones that were gathered by Mandibuzz."},{"version":"black","text":"Its wings are too tiny to allow it to fly. As the time approaches for it to evolve, it discards the bones it was wearing."},{"version":"white","text":"They tend to guard their posteriors with suitable bones they have found. They pursue weak Pokémon."},{"version":"sun","text":"It protects its plump posterior with the bones of prey it has consumed. As it grows, it replaces the bones."},{"version":"moon","text":"It can’t fly yet and must wait until its wings have developed more. Since it’s still at a playful age, it hops around friskily."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Mandibuzz gives it the bones it wears. Vullaby’s wings are short, so it can’t fly yet, but it jumps around, dreaming of wide open skies."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its healthy appetite leads to visible growth spurts. It often has to replace the bones it wears as its size increases."},{"version":"sword","text":"It wears a bone to protect its rear. It often squabbles with others of its kind over particularly comfy bones.